---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — SizeToolsHub"
  description="Read SizeToolsHub's Terms of Service. By using our sizing tools and converters, you agree to these terms."
  canonicalUrl="https://sizetoolshub.com/terms/"
>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-20">

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline-soft mb-6 shadow-2xs">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">Legal</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-10 text-text-muted">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          By accessing and using <strong class="text-ink">SizeToolsHub</strong> (sizetoolshub.com), you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our website or services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          SizeToolsHub provides free online tools for international size and unit conversion, including but not limited to:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 pl-4 mt-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Shoe and footwear size conversion across international systems</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Clothing and apparel size charts</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Ring size calculators</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Cooking and measurement conversions</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Data storage unit conversion</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Paper size and dimension tools</span></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">3. Accuracy Disclaimer</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-3">
          SizeToolsHub makes every effort to provide accurate conversion data based on official standards (ISO, ASTM, and manufacturer specifications). However:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 pl-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong class="text-ink">Brand tolerances vary.</strong> Individual manufacturers may use slightly different measurements than the standard sizing charts. We recommend consulting the specific brand's size guide before purchasing.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong class="text-ink">Standards evolve.</strong> International sizing standards are periodically updated. While we strive to keep our data current, some information may not reflect the very latest revisions.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong class="text-ink">No warranty.</strong> The tools and information provided are offered "as-is" without warranty of any kind, express or implied.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          SizeToolsHub and its operators shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising from:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 pl-4 mt-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Your use of or inability to use the service</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Purchases made based on conversion results from our tools</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Any errors or inaccuracies in the conversion data</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Interruptions or downtime of the service</span></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          All content on SizeToolsHub — including text, graphics, logos, conversion tables, and software — is the property of SizeToolsHub or its content suppliers and is protected by applicable copyright and intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works without our explicit written permission.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mt-3">
          Underlying sizing standards (ISO, ASTM, etc.) are the property of their respective standard bodies and are referenced here for informational purposes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">6. Permitted Use</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-3">You may use SizeToolsHub for personal, non-commercial purposes. You agree <strong class="text-ink">not</strong> to:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 pl-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Scrape or systematically harvest content from the site</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Use our tools in any way that could damage, disable, or overburden our servers</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to any portion of the service</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Use the site for any unlawful purpose</span></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">7. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Our website may contain links to third-party websites or services that are not owned or controlled by SizeToolsHub. We have no control over and assume no responsibility for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party websites. We encourage you to review the terms and privacy policies of any third-party sites you visit.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">8. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Service at any time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. Continued use of the service after any changes constitutes your acceptance of the new terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">9. Governing Law</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          These terms shall be governed and construed in accordance with applicable laws, without regard to conflict of law provisions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">10. Contact</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us through <strong class="text-ink">sizetoolshub.com</strong>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>

    <!-- Footer nav -->
    <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-hairline-soft flex flex-wrap gap-6 text-sm text-text-muted">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors">← Back to Home</a>
      <a href="/privacy/" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>
      <a href="/about/" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors">About Us</a>
    </div>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>
